---
---

<section class="problem section" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem-hero-image animate-in">
      <img src="/images/hero-lifestyle.jpeg" alt="Woman lifting dumbbells by the window with countryside view" class="problem-hero-img" />
    </div>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-text">
        <span class="section-label animate-in" data-i18n="problem.label">The Difference</span>
        <h2 class="section-title animate-in" data-i18n="problem.title">
          Your cycle is your superpower
        </h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle animate-in" data-i18n="problem.subtitle">
          Your body follows a unique rhythm. Diamo listens to your cycle, energy, and daily life to create workouts that move with you.
        </p>
        <p class="problem-detail animate-in" data-i18n="problem.detail">
          Diamo is the <strong>first software only solution</strong> that connects daily biometric data 
          with a hormonal performance system and a local community.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="problem-visual animate-in">
        <div class="comparison-card">
          <div class="comparison-side old">
            <div class="comparison-icon">✕</div>
            <h4 data-i18n="problem.without">Without Diamo</h4>
            <ul>
              <li data-i18n="problem.old1">Generic workout plans</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.old2">Ignoring your cycle</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.old3">Training alone at home</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.old4">Expensive hardware required</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.old5">Data without action</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-divider">
            <div class="comparison-vs">vs</div>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-side new">
            <div class="comparison-icon">✓</div>
            <h4 data-i18n="problem.with">With Diamo</h4>
            <ul>
              <li data-i18n="problem.new1">Cycle synced training</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.new2">Adapts to your energy</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.new3">Connected community</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.new4">Software only, no hardware</li>
              <li data-i18n="problem.new5">Actionable daily insights</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .problem-hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    height: 420px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .problem-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
    display: block;
    transition: transform var(--transition-slow);
  }

  .problem-hero-image:hover .problem-hero-img {
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .problem-detail {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .problem-detail strong {
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .comparison-card {
    display: flex;
    background: var(--ivory);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .comparison-side {
    flex: 1;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .comparison-side h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .comparison-side ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .comparison-side ul li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .comparison-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .old .comparison-icon {
    background: rgba(111, 13, 13, 0.08);
    color: var(--burgundy);
  }

  .old ul li::before {
    content: '•';
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .new .comparison-icon {
    background: rgba(141, 198, 166, 0.15);
    color: var(--sage);
  }

  .new ul li::before {
    content: '✦';
    color: var(--lavender);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
  }

  .comparison-divider {
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--divider);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .comparison-vs {
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--ivory);
    padding: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .problem-text .animate-in:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
  .problem-text .animate-in:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
  .problem-text .animate-in:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
  .problem-text .animate-in:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 0.4s; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .problem-hero-image {
      height: 280px;
    }

    .comparison-card {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .comparison-divider {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
    }
  }
</style>
